    "0Small, nonpolar, light gases: He, H2,\n"
    "0Ne. Gases like NH3 and H2O deviate\n"
    "0the most because they hydrogen bond.\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Rule of thumb\n"
    "0The ideal gas law is good to within a\n"
    "0few percent at ordinary temperatures\n"
    "0and pressures near 1 atm.";

